NOTE ON GAME ASSETS / 关于游戏素材

The MIT license above covers this project's own source code and its compiled
lineup/strategy data. It does NOT cover the game artwork bundled under
`assets/` (map minimaps, agent portraits, ability icons) or the metadata
derived from Riot's public API. Those remain the property of Riot Games, Inc.
and are included here solely to make this unofficial, non-commercial fan
reference work. See the "素材与免责声明" section of README.md.

上述 MIT 许可仅覆盖本项目自己的源代码与整理出的点位/打法数据，**不覆盖**
`assets/` 下的游戏美术素材（小地图、特工头像、技能图标）以及来自 Riot 公开
API 的元数据 —— 这些版权归 Riot Games, Inc. 所有，此处仅用于呈现这个非官方、
非商业的粉丝向参考资料。详见 README.md 的「素材与免责声明」。
